    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Which of the following has the most number of 1s in its binary representation?\n\n$$\nABE_{16}\\qquad CDF_{16}\\qquad 7531_{8}\\qquad 6420_{8}\n$$",
        "zh": "下面哪个数字转换成二进制数后,含有数字1的数量最多?\n\n$$\nABE_{16}\\qquad CDF_{16}\\qquad 7531_{8}\\qquad 6420_{8}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$ABE_{16}$",
            "zh": "$ABE_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$CDF_{16}$",
            "zh": "$CDF_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$7531_{8}$",
            "zh": "$7531_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "$6420_{8}$",
            "zh": "$6420_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "more than 1 answer",
            "zh": "不止一个"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\n| Number | Binary | Number of 1s |\n|---|---|---|\n| $ABE_{16}$ | 1010 1011 1110 | 8 |\n| $CDF_{16}$ | 1100 1101 1111 | 9 |\n| $7531_8$ | 111 101 011 001 | 8 |\n| $6420_8$ | 110 100 010 000 | 4 |\n\n$CDF_{16}$ has the most 1s.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n十六进制每位展开为四位，八进制每位展开为三位。$ABE_{16}$ 的三组有 2、3、3 个 1，共 8 个；$CDF_{16}$ 有 2、3、4 个，共 9 个；$7531_8$ 和 $6420_8$ 分别有 8 和 4 个，所以 $CDF_{16}$ 最多。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "The year 2022 is $3746_8$. How many years remain until the year $5072_8$? Express the difference in octal.",
        "zh": "年份 2022 的八进制表示是 $3746_8$。距离年份 $5072_8$ 还有多少年？请用八进制表示年数。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "1023",
            "zh": "1023"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "1124",
            "zh": "1124"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "1326",
            "zh": "1326"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "2336",
            "zh": "2336"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "10020",
            "zh": "10020"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\n$$\\begin{array}{r}5072_8\\\\-\\;3746_8\\\\\\hline1124_8\\end{array}$$\n\nBorrow 8 when needed. The ones digit is $10-6=4$, the eights digit is $6-4=2$, the next is $8-7=1$, and the leading digit is $4-3=1$.",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n计算 $5072_8-3746_8$。个位借一个 8，得 $10-6=4$，八位剩 6，减 4 得 2。六十四位的 0 从左侧借位后成十进制 8，减 7 得 1；最左位剩 $4-3=1$。结果 $1124_8$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Place the following numbers in increasing order:\n\n$$\na)1101010_{2}\\qquad b)5F_{16}\\qquad c)124_{8}\\qquad d)100_{10}\n$$",
        "zh": "请将以下数字从小到大进行排列:\n\n$$\na)1101010_{2}\\qquad b)5F_{16}\\qquad c)124_{8}\\qquad d)100_{10}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "b, c, a, d",
            "zh": "b, c, a, d"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "b, c, d, a",
            "zh": "b, c, d, a"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "c, b, d, a",
            "zh": "c, b, d, a"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "c, d, a, b",
            "zh": "c, d, a, b"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "d, a, c, b",
            "zh": "d, a, c, b"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nConverting each number to base 10 in order to compare them is:\n\n$$\na)1101010_{2}=2+8+32+64=106\n$$\n\n$$\nb)5F_{16}=15+5*16=15+80=95\n$$\n\n$$\nc)124_{8}=4+2*8+1*64=4+16+64=84\n$$\n\n$$\nd)100_{10}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the order is 84, 95, 100, 106 or c, b, d, a.\n\nSource correction: the extra “106” in the original $5F_{16}$ conversion is a typographical error.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n先把不同进制统一成十进制。a 是 $64+32+8+2=106$，b 是 $5\\times16+15=95$，c 是 $64+2\\times8+4=84$，d 是 100。按 $84<95<100<106$ 排列为 c、b、d、a。原解析在 b 的换算后多写了 106，实际为 95。"
      },
      "source": {
