    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Compare each RGB component of the hexadecimal colors “#409AF7” and “#348DE9”. What is the difference in hexadecimal for the component that has the smallest difference in value?",
        "zh": "比较十六进制数表示的颜色“#409AF7”和“#348DE9”中每个RGB部分。差值最小的部分转换为十六进制后的差是多少?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "0A",
            "zh": "0A"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "0B",
            "zh": "0B"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "0C",
            "zh": "0C"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "0D",
            "zh": "0D"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "0E",
            "zh": "0E"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nThe red components are 40 and 34 and the difference is 16 - 4 = 12 or 0C. The green components are 9A and 8D and the difference is 26 - 13 = 13 or 0D. The blue components are F7 and E9 and the difference is 23 - 9 = 14 or 0E. The smallest difference is 0C.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n将两种颜色各拆成三个通道，逐通道比较。红色 $40_{16}-34_{16}=0C_{16}$，绿色 $9A_{16}-8D_{16}=0D_{16}$，蓝色 $F7_{16}-E9_{16}=0E_{16}$。三项高位均为 0，比较末位即可，最小是红色差值 $0C_{16}$。"
      },
